# Loaded automatically by Firebase Functions v2 only when running against
# the `demo-trivia-app-e2e` project — i.e. only inside the local emulator
# (Cypress `npm run e2e`) or Lighthouse CI, never a real Stripe-backed
# deploy. Safe to commit: not a secret, just a feature flag.
#
# Skips real Stripe API calls entirely in createCheckoutSession (see
# src/checkout-sessions.ts) and writes back a deterministic fake session
# instead, so e2e tests never need real Stripe credentials.
STRIPE_MOCK_CHECKOUT=true
